# What `docker build` may see. Everything is excluded, then only what the image needs is
# let back in: a new file (a secret, model weights, local runs) stays out by default.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!scripts/build_db.py
!data/policies/
# Even inside the allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
